            <sparkle:version>5</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.4.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Tuck handle</h2>
<p>Windows you've parked now show a small amber handle on their top edge, above the traffic lights, while they're out: click it to tuck the window back, Option-click to release it. Turn it off in Settings → General.</p>
<h2>Fixes</h2>
<p>Tabs no longer disappear after the Mac sleeps and wakes. Moving a revealed window keeps its tab (releasing is now always explicit). Right-clicking a tab closes its preview before the menu opens.</p>
]]></description>
